    "the gift": "This cycle brings the energy of diligence — the unglamorous, essential work of getting better through sustained practice.",
    "what to release": "The expectation that mastery should feel different from this. This is what mastery feels like: another repetition.",
    "the seed": "Plant the intention to develop one skill through deliberate, patient practice this lunar cycle.",
    "the obstacle": "Boredom. The Eight of Pentacles is not an exciting card. Neither is mastery, most of the time.",
